NumNodes [SimTalk] - Frame
Returns the number of objects in the Frame designated by <Path>.
Remarks
Each additional Frame you insert into the selected Frame counts as a single object. Plant Simulation does
not count the objects contained within the Frames.
Connectors also count as objects.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.NumNodes → integer
Return Value
The return value has the data type integer.
Example
print .Models.MyPlant.NumNodes
See also
node [SimTalk] - Frame
